# radio-stations — the saved station list for bin/radio.
#
# One station per line, "Name<TAB>URL". Blank lines and #-comment lines are
# ignored; everything else must carry a real tab. `radio save` appends here,
# and because chezmoi runs in symlink mode this file IS the repo file — a
# station saved on one machine is a diff you commit, not local drift.
#
# Every URL below was fetched and confirmed streaming on 2026-08-08. Stations
# rot: when one goes quiet, `radio search <name>` finds a live replacement
# from radio-browser.info and `radio save` records it.

